Add smoke test for embedding and postMessage behavior

Verifies postMessage events for web-server targets and load time
metrics for web-embedded targets. Includes a test harness HTML page
that simulates the AWS Console parent frame by embedding the editor
in an iframe and collecting postMessage events.
